- Classic Pop Blast", "keywords": ["Bubble", "Shooter", "popping", "bubbles", "Blast"], "long_description": "Welcome to VR Bubble Shooter Classic Pop Blast, a vibrant and immersive virtual reality take on the timeless bubble shooter genre. Designed specifically for Meta Quest, this game combines classic pop mechanics with intuitive VR controls and cheerful visuals that surround you in every level.\n\nEnter a bright seaside world where colorful bubbles float above and your goal is simple yet addictive. Aim carefully match colors and pop bubbles to clear the board. Every shot feels satisfying as bubbles burst with smooth animations and delightful sound effects that enhance the VR experience.\n\nThe gameplay is easy to learn and comfortable for players of all skill levels. Use your VR controllers to aim naturally and shoot bubbles with precision. As you progress through levels the puzzles become more challenging encouraging smart shots and strategic thinking while remaining relaxing and enjoyable.\n\nThe friendly characters colorful bubble designs and clear visual layout make the game welcoming and fun. Whether you are playing for a few minutes or enjoying longer sessions VR Bubble Shooter Classic Pop Blast is perfect for casual VR gaming.\n\nKey highlights of the experience include immersive VR bubble shooting classic match based puzzle gameplay vibrant and family friendly visuals smooth performance on Meta Quest and relaxing pressure free fun suitable for all ages.\n\nIf you enjoy classic bubble shooters this VR experience delivers a polished and satisfying pop blast adventure.", "short_description": "Step into a colorful VR world and enjoy classic bubble shooting fun. Aim shoot and pop vibrant bubbles using VR controllers in a relaxing and immersive puzzle experience made for Meta Quest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nomanawan89.wixsite.com/brokenengineers", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Broken Eng